                <l xml:id="m-c0f1b908-1fc7-426a-984f-38d74c62bf64" facs="#m-957fb9fc-127d-433c-ae4c-40eaa2631049" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember Week of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-038da662-1bcb-432c-b8f2-787638d5124a" facs="#m-99f175c5-6e31-4154-8940-02de1914c4d0" label="ambiguous">343</l><l xml:id="m-c5b931c4-aecf-4439-915d-86fabf5ed0b3" facs="#m-67d1d727-bbfd-41fb-9575-fc4d05819dfd" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember Week of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-64b850b3-9ed2-42bf-95b9-f8978d1c5f38" facs="#m-9066fae7-398d-4651-8359-b8c37d6b1c07" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-6a32e1af-eb17-4fec-81fa-78124402e637" facs="#m-704a9df1-1f23-4199-bc4c-aefeb93a2c15" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-b12d9e96-3aef-4fef-84bf-c19c403f5b70" facs="#m-08675378-d015-4293-84e5-035b8503bf4c" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-497a4f40-30e4-49c1-8336-81f4d5ae686b" facs="#m-eeb50366-2416-4363-9f3f-57c0f8ce2e98" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-97d64d19-fbfd-43e8-b3b2-cddf04e482a1" facs="#m-95bf60d5-cd31-45ab-8978-b1408a243c36" label="lyrics-like">Éni, * et osténde nó- bis fá-ci¬ em tú-am, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-71b3ec31-0406-42e4-93f8-a5fb79a7220e" facs="#m-3952f1bd-58a1-47bb-a186-2889b4eb80d2" label="lyrics-like">mi- ne, qui sé-des su-per Chéru-bim: et sál-vi é¬ ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0e473b8-c98e-4deb-a745-c13811c79964" facs="#m-929ff8ec-711b-494c-904d-bbc97f4f98ce" label="lyrics-like">mus. Ps. Qui ré-gis Isra-el, inténde: “ qui dedú-cis vel-ut</l><l xml:id="m-0d423834-cbb9-42d5-8940-f12a5f015cda" facs="#m-60922746-53f3-4130-81da-8b567a085a4f" label="lyrics-like">é-vem Jó-seph. Gló-ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-35e4438d-6954-4241-a839-b4c606436cd9" facs="#m-078aa551-70bc-49ba-a46b-b5b78ccaa914" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. for the Ferias of Advent. p. 62.</l><l xml:id="m-b2fe641c-4efc-429b-95b9-485e9b69ec6d" facs="#m-76e1e2d3-07dc-467a-9483-4f6a88fb32e8" label="lyrics-like">officiating priest. Orémus. Deacon. Flectámus génua. Sab-Deacon.</l><l xml:id="m-2f4f50ce-0330-45f1-b362-95845c071c73" facs="#m-1f6cf057-1fbe-4826-be74-512c78ac9751" label="lyrics-like">R. Levá̂te.</l><l xml:id="m-80e300c1-ed18-431a-b5ed-73f3b73a8a1a" facs="#m-8ab1bf87-175e-4574-b31c-ea78041ef5c0" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2efff713-9f0d-4c48-8dc1-37187529e0d0" facs="#m-94606c48-7cb5-4192-8d19-2ae5c3b24395" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui cónspicis, quia ex no-[ céde propitius; ut ex tua visitatióne</l><l xml:id="m-d60111ec-f8d7-4e38-ba19-2ce65459b7a1" facs="#m-63336404-9f61-4ff0-a58c-7dc41ca8d869" label="lyrics-like">Ustra pravitâte affligimur: con-consolémur : Qui vivis.</l><l xml:id="m-67eee596-c52e-4087-9c38-cae676c2febf" facs="#m-98c3ebf1-6e98-449d-b720-374245e0233d" label="ambiguous">Lesson I.</l><l xml:id="m-9b6db9f3-b022-4187-814d-16b2a8922267" facs="#m-ec3f7d68-7881-4c74-b17a-97d36ce35bbd" label="lyrics-like">Léctio Isaiae Prophétae. Is. 19.</l><l xml:id="m-8a72420d-3492-4913-b194-53c8fc640f05" facs="#m-282b5ce7-7e36-40a3-98d2-aac96c0b9647" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis : Clamábunt ad Dó-] munéribus: et vota vovébunt Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-99c11816-fe59-448f-8300-8595c4b36e8f" facs="#m-c16a7aa3-e3bb-4863-bb8e-4e5e0e09632e" label="lyrics-like">mino, et solvent. Et percútiet Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e18d6e14-b2f0-45ab-ba2f-faff9f8e196d" facs="#m-4eb7b83e-842d-4f3e-a250-d06bf516ce37" label="lyrics-like">L minum a fácie tribulántis, et mit¬</l><l xml:id="m-3bc7e52e-b52c-4f5f-9bcc-6731144ff7fd" facs="#m-6d735f33-5ee3-4c55-94ec-e61242297dea" label="lyrics-like">minus Aegyptum plaga, et sanábit</l><l xml:id="m-0efcdb9e-968f-4d3d-9dd0-8b02625559ee" facs="#m-6ed11be9-3240-427f-b481-85567f97ad29" label="lyrics-like">tet eis salvatórem, et propugnató¬</l><l xml:id="m-22978e9f-67bb-434e-b426-2cced57edcbc" facs="#m-c22164aa-fdad-4c95-b8b2-cdeaf02f53f3" label="lyrics-like">eam: et reverténtur ad Dóminum,</l><l xml:id="m-991f94cf-9f94-477f-b993-6ad56e9b8e7f" facs="#m-a6af6a0b-7b2e-4217-a8d8-2aa1b2d638b2" label="lyrics-like">rem, qui liberet eos. Et cognoscétur</l><l xml:id="m-b1fcf4ef-48e0-4228-96f3-10a075d4f56d" facs="#m-a376a964-a6da-49d5-85d6-c21eac08dbe1" label="lyrics-like">et placábitur eis, et sanábit eos Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-70511685-7445-42b7-b683-47270b94ad76" facs="#m-ec26923a-cbd2-4a9e-97d9-095a996ca6b5" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus ab Aegypto, et cognó¬</l><l xml:id="m-dafa65c5-0504-40b6-b828-f1d2bbd2c9d7" facs="#m-069efba0-dc9a-405a-8a54-8d98c68d5d20" label="ambiguous">minus Deus noster.</l><l xml:id="m-d7d7d7ad-c45d-4ae4-89ac-c8e3f966c99e" facs="#m-4d43f6b9-a613-4d67-bbc8-6f5e30297382" label="lyrics-like">scent Aegyptii Dóminum in die</l><l xml:id="m-17f8bd5c-ab7e-46a5-a508-cf6a3e32bfaf" facs="#m-c9b56152-e2f0-468f-ad9a-844376afd0d3" label="lyrics-like">illa: et colent eum in hóstiis, et in</l><l xml:id="m-13e312e8-ac14-4729-8667-1dda6131decc" facs="#m-08b94966-9ef1-4bca-93ae-ca883f856d77" label="ambiguous">1.Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-3dc829de-af79-49f9-94d8-a9c28bc75178" facs="#m-704ab39f-a0af-4195-b8ad-8e15d89634df" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-53b73eb4-7c28-46b4-b387-519cd1c44ab9" facs="#m-f75a55e6-1fba-49cd-b68e-f05fc04b8aea" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-ee86734d-beac-4d19-93ce-cb63e7a42e6a" facs="#m-81dab6f0-bd99-41ac-ac39-797bc4e0e26a" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-797a7ba6-0c7e-42ca-b44b-e23e564ecf3d" facs="#m-c13accd7-3894-42b0-b173-98ad20b0ea26" label="lyrics-like">súmmo“ caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-376082c8-545b-4f7f-a232-aef7c84ce792" facs="#m-ed11e3de-4f35-4312-a467-eae8debdff8d" label="lyrics-like">lo egrés- si¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c4f5203-8763-43f1-9e64-429daeb47f99" facs="#m-7ea82552-5fe5-41dd-b05d-ea0c015d311f" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-686f71e0-d1f7-4087-8338-7889fd764445" facs="#m-eedcebdf-8247-43c9-a30b-e2e36f739c56" label="ambiguous">jus</l><l xml:id="m-5e1c9b0a-ba61-4107-bce3-f3be50b2c5e3" facs="#m-fae195ae-4c72-4454-8eda-00aef294cc26" label="lyrics-like">et occúr-sus</l><l xml:id="m-e0a483b2-